ection_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:ab078da15645a5fa03126c0cdd20dfe26fa357cd4028ca4d5f3a489f228eda2c","file":"preprints/Hamiltonian-Fixed-Points-Below-the-Stable-Morse-Number-in-Dimension-Twenty-Two-October-5-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":37,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"352258d40edf5ebc13c33e86bfb9fa7886466625e825750f2d51afec40cade90","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Hamiltonian-Fixed-Points-Below-the-Stable-Morse-Number-in-Dimension-Twenty-Two-October-5-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:ab078da15645a5fa03126c0cdd20dfe26fa357cd4028ca4d5f3a489f228eda2c","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Hamiltonian-Fixed-Points-Below-the-Stable-Morse-Number-in-Dimension-Twenty-Two-October-5-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L37"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor every integer $m\\geq1$, there exist a simply connected closed Kähler\nmanifold $(M_m,\\omega_m)$ of real dimension $22$ and a smooth one-periodic\nHamiltonian $H_m$ such that all fixed points of $\\phi_{H_m}^1$ are\nnondegenerate and\n\\begin{align*}\n \\SM(M_m)&=80+1968m,\\\\\n \\#\\Fix(\\phi_{H_m}^1)\n &=\\#\\Fix_0(\\phi_{H_m}^1;H_m)=80+1952m.\n\\end{align*}\nConsequently, with $\\delta=1/128$, for every $R>0$ some member of this\nfamily satisfies\n\\[\n \\SM(M_m)\\geq R,\\qquad\n \\#\\Fix(\\phi_{H_m}^1)\\leq(1-\\delta)\\SM(M_m).\n\\]"}
